## 👏 Acknowledgments & Dependencies

This project is built with and inspired by the following open-source frameworks and AI services:

* **[LangChain](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain)** - Framework for developing applications powered by language models.
* **[OpenAI API](https://openai.com/)** - Powering LLM extractions (ChatGPT 5.5) and text embeddings (`text-embedding-3-large`).
* **[DeepSeek API](https://www.deepseek.com/)** - Powering dual-agent validation (`deepseek-v4-pro`).
* **[BERTScore](https://github.com/TatsuyaHoshino/BERTScore)** - Automatic evaluation metric for text generation using `roberta-large`.
* **[Pandas](https://pandas.pydata.org/) & [scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/)** - Data manipulation and similarity evaluation.